From: M3 Pro development program
Subject: [PATCH] m1n1: preserve and traverse retained T8110 table levels

Development-only C hierarchy and lifetime prerequisite. Retained mode and
reported geometry select the walker; fresh contexts keep their old mode.
No target region selection, RTKit DVA widening or hardware activation.

